OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister rejects
OL,4,AReform-style mega donations to
OL,5,Apolitical parties
OL,6,
OL,7,FWales' First Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth
OL,8,Fhas said he would not accept huge
OL,9,Fpolitical donations like the #72m
OL,10,Freceived by Reform UK from two
OL,11,Fcryptocurrency businessmen.
OL,13,FThe Plaid Cymru leader asked the BBC's
OL,14,FLaura Kuenssberg on Sunday: "Have these
OL,15,Ftwo individuals altruistically decided
OL,16,Fthat they want for the common man and
OL,17,Fwoman to make life better?
OL,19,F"Or perhaps are they interested in the
OL,20,Fderegulation of [the] crypto agenda -
OL,21,Fthat I've heard mentioned by Reform in
OL,22,Fthe past."
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
