OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister rejects
OL,4,AReform-style mega donations to
OL,5,Apolitical parties
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking on the same programme, Reform
OL,8,Feconomic spokesman Robert Jenrick said
OL,9,Fthe party believed the donations were
OL,10,F"entirely in line with the law".
